    {
      "block_id": "2605.25036_p16_b1",
      "text": "1. Stimuli and Task Definition.\nWe randomly sampled 100 images from the COCO 2014 validation split. For each\nimage, the models were given a single, open-ended instruction: \"Please help me describe the image in\ndetail\". This prompt was chosen to encourage the generation of long-form, descriptive text, which provides a rich\ncontext for identifying potential hallucinations.\n",
      "bbox": [
        55.44,
        69.3,
        541.44,
        115.3
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
        221,
        277,
        2165,
        461
      ],
      "coord_space": "pdf_points",
      "font_size": 10.06,
      "font_name": "NimbusRomNo9L-Medi",
      "is_math": false,
      "char_count": 373,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.25036_p16_b2",
      "text": "2. Models.\nWe compared three versions of the LLaVA-v1.5-7B model:\n",
      "bbox": [
        55.44,
        131.84,
        347.32,
        141.9
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
        221,
        527,
        1389,
        567
      ],
      "coord_space": "pdf_points",
      "font_size": 9.96,
      "font_name": "NimbusRomNo9L-Medi",
      "is_math": false,
      "char_count": 65,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.25036_p16_b3",
      "text": "\u2022 Baseline: The standard model after completing Visual Instruction Tuning (VIT) and Direct Preference Tuning (DPO).\n",
      "bbox": [
        66.9,
        159.5,
        543.16,
        169.53
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
        267,
        638,
        2172,
        678
      ],
      "coord_space": "pdf_points",
      "font_size": 9.96,
      "font_name": "NimbusRomNo9L-Regu",
      "is_math": false,
      "char_count": 115,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.25036_p16_b4",
      "text": "\u2022 LBR (ours): The baseline model trained with our Language Bias Regularization.\n",
      "bbox": [
        66.9,
        182.86,
        399.83,
        192.91
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
        267,
        731,
        1599,
        771
      ],
      "coord_space": "pdf_points",
      "font_size": 9.96,
      "font_name": "NimbusRomNo9L-Regu",
      "is_math": false,
      "char_count": 79,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.25036_p16_b5",
      "text": "\u2022 LBP (ours): The baseline model trained with our Language Bias Penalty.\n",
      "bbox": [
        66.9,
        206.24,
