    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.25036_p16_b6",
      "text": "3. Hallucination Taxonomy and Annotation Rules.\nOur evaluation is based on a detailed hallucination taxonomy. Three\ntrained human annotators were tasked with identifying and categorizing errors in the generated text based on the visual\nevidence. We categorize hallucinations into six types:\n",
      "bbox": [
        55.44,
        233.95,
        541.44,
        267.83
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
        221,
        935,
        2165,
        1071
      ],
      "coord_space": "pdf_points",
      "font_size": 9.86,
      "font_name": "NimbusRomNo9L-Medi",
      "is_math": false,
      "char_count": 290,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.25036_p16_b7",
      "text": "\u2022 Existence: The model describes objects that do not exist in the image.\n",
      "bbox": [
        66.9,
        285.41,
        355.84,
        295.47
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
        267,
        1141,
        1423,
        1181
      ],
      "coord_space": "pdf_points",
      "font_size": 9.96,
      "font_name": "NimbusRomNo9L-Regu",
      "is_math": false,
      "char_count": 72,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.25036_p16_b8",
      "text": "\u2022 Attribute: Incorrect properties of an object (e.g., color or size) are hallucinated.\n",
      "bbox": [
        66.9,
        308.79,
        394.94,
        318.85
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
        267,
        1235,
        1579,
        1275
      ],
      "coord_space": "pdf_points",
      "font_size": 9.96,
      "font_name": "NimbusRomNo9L-Regu",
      "is_math": false,
      "char_count": 86,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.25036_p16_b9",
      "text": "\u2022 State: The condition or status of an object is incorrectly described (e.g., \u201copen\u201d vs. \u201cclosed\u201d).\n",
      "bbox": [
        66.9,
        332.18,
        449.75,
        342.23
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
        267,
        1328,
        1798,
        1368
      ],
      "coord_space": "pdf_points",
      "font_size": 9.96,
      "font_name": "NimbusRomNo9L-Regu",
      "is_math": false,
      "char_count": 99,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.25036_p16_b10",
      "text": "\u2022 Number: The count of objects is inaccurately stated.\n",
      "bbox": [
        66.9,
        355.56,
        287.35,
        365.61
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
        267,
        1422,
        1149,
        1462
      ],
      "coord_space": "pdf_points",
      "font_size": 9.96,
      "font_name": "NimbusRomNo9L-Regu",
      "is_math": false,
      "char_count": 54,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.25036_p16_b11",
      "text": "\u2022 Action: Actions or activities that are not occurring are mistakenly attributed to objects.\n",
      "bbox": [
        66.9,
        378.94,
        422.31,
        388.99
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
        267,
        1515,
        1689,
        1555
      ],
      "coord_space": "pdf_points",
      "font_size": 9.96,
      "font_name": "NimbusRomNo9L-Regu",
      "is_math": false,
      "char_count": 92,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.25036_p16_b12",
      "text": "\u2022 Relation: False spatial or semantic relationships between objects are generated.\n",
      "bbox": [
        66.9,
        402.32,
        394.0,
        412.38
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
        267,
        1609,
        1575,
        1649
      ],
      "coord_space": "pdf_points",
      "font_size": 9.96,
      "font_name": "NimbusRomNo9L-Regu",
      "is_math": false,
      "char_count": 82,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.25036_p16_b13",
      "text": "To ensure consistency in annotation, we established the following rules:\n",
      "bbox": [
        55.13,
        430.04,
        341.16,
        440.01
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
        220,
        1720,
        1364,
        1760
      ],
      "coord_space": "pdf_points",
      "font_size": 9.96,
      "font_name": "NimbusRomNo9L-Regu",
      "is_math": false,
      "char_count": 72,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.25036_p16_b14",
      "text": "1. For an initial Existence hallucination, any subsequent errors concerning the same non-existent object (e.g., its attributes,\nstate, or relations) are not counted as additional hallucinations to avoid penalizing cascading errors.\n",
      "bbox": [
        62.91,
        457.66,
        542.69,
        479.59
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
        251,
        1830,
        2170,
        1918
      ],
      "coord_space": "pdf_points",
      "font_size": 9.96,
      "font_name": "NimbusRomNo9L-Regu",
      "is_math": false,
      "char_count": 231,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.25036_p16_b15",
      "text": "2. Descriptions that explicitly convey uncertainty (e.g., \u201cit seems like\u201d, \u201cthere might be\u201d) without introducing a concrete\nfactual error are not considered hallucinations.\n",
      "bbox": [
        62.91,
        493.01,
        541.44,
        514.93
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
        251,
        1972,
        2165,
        2059
      ],
      "coord_space": "pdf_points",
      "font_size": 9.96,
      "font_name": "NimbusRomNo9L-Regu",
      "is_math": false,
      "char_count": 172,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.25036_p16_b16",
      "text": "The final error count for each generated response was determined by a majority vote among the annotators.\n",
      "bbox": [
        55.13,
